    is missing with zero surviving evidence (a failed/stranded mirror
    creation) or is an intact ``bound``/``rolled_back`` mirror with no
    journal, snapshot, marker, handle or durable event -- i.e. the
    provider was never effectively called. Anything less provable raises
    ArtifactStrandUnavailable: the operation stays pending, the scene
    stays parked for the next process restart, and no provider is called
    twice.
    """
